  "details": "if people want to modify vrchat why not just create a seperate server that doesnt connect to the original vrchat servers like gta 5 does with there servers.\n\nfor example: when you press play on steam it should say play in vr, play without eac but you wont be able to login to vrchat, and then theres the option of playing on desktop.\n\nthis should only be server based so no friends will be able to join unless they select that play without eac function, so it is limited to only those players.\n\nAlso worlds should only be provided by vrchat  and players should not be able to import any customized worlds and all avatars should only be provided by vrchat and not customizably importable into the game. \n\nThus its limited function.\n\nif i knew how many servers the vrchat dev team have made this should be easy to do.\n\nheck lock it behind a paywall on steam id pay for it.",
